define('taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/helper/scoringModelSave',['taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/helper/scoringModelForm', 'taoQtiItem/qtiCreator/helper/scoringModelHelper'], function (scoringModelForm, scoringModelHelper) {
  'use strict';
  var register = function register(qtiCreatorContext, getItem) {
    if (!qtiCreatorContext || qtiCreatorContext._scoringModelSaveRegistered) {
      return;
    }
    qtiCreatorContext._scoringModelSaveRegistered = true;
    qtiCreatorContext.trigger('registerBeforeSaveProcess', () => {
      var item = getItem();
      if (!item) {
        return;
      }
      scoringModelForm.flushOpenForms(item);
      scoringModelHelper.ensurePersistedBeforeSave(item);
    });
  };
  return {
    register
  };
});
